1 0 obj<</Author(orphan_account)/CreationDate(D:20261101023618+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Teen And Up Audiences, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora & Bow & Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Bow/Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Catra & Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Adora & Bow & Catra & Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Perfuma/Scorpia \(She-Ra\), Catra & Scorpia \(She-Ra\), Catra & Entrapta & Scorpia \(She-Ra\), Netossa/Spinnerella \(She-Ra\), Catra & Netossa \(She-Ra\), Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Bow \(She-Ra\), Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Scorpia \(She-Ra\), Perfuma \(She-Ra\), Entrapta \(She-Ra\), Netossa \(She-Ra\), Spinnerella \(She-Ra\), Angella \(She-Ra\), Depressed Catra, Catra Goes to Therapy \(She-Ra\), \(kind of\), perfuma and catra interacting, netossa and spinerella being good moms, suicidal catra, lots of suicidal thoughts pls be careful, angst n fluff n stuff, Autistic Entrapta, uwu??????????, scorpia and catra having quality conversations, bow is the mom friend, she ra college au, catra is rlly sad, so is adora, shkjjfsjdhfh angsty mm, healing from depression, PTSD, college au kind of idk how to explain it, maybe they have colleges in etheria idk, Wow this is dark, F/F, F/M, Graphic Depictions Of Violence, i was thinking about New York when i wrote this fic so yeah???, also mentions of eating disorders, Emotional Hurt/Comfort, healing Catra tho eventually, catradora, also yeah Angella is still alive, there's a lot of plot holes here don't @ me, im tryibg everyone i know this is a mess, ok i should stop)/ModDate(D:20261101023618+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(Baby steps)>>
