          <rdf:li>(kind of)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>perfuma and catra interacting</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>netossa and spinerella being good moms</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>suicidal catra</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>lots of suicidal thoughts pls be careful</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>angst n fluff n stuff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Autistic Entrapta</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>uwu??????????</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>scorpia and catra having quality conversations</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>bow is the mom friend</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>she ra college au</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>catra is rlly sad</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>so is adora</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>shkjjfsjdhfh angsty mm</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>healing from depression</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>PTSD</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>college au kind of idk how to explain it</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>maybe they have colleges in etheria idk</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Wow this is dark</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/M</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Graphic Depictions Of Violence</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>i was thinking about New York when i wrote this fic so yeah???</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>also mentions of eating disorders</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Emotional Hurt/Comfort</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>healing Catra tho eventually</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>catradora</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>also yeah Angella is still alive</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>there's a lot of plot holes here don't @ me</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>im tryibg everyone i know this is a mess</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>ok i should stop</rdf:li>
